ᵉgôwrah","gloss":"fear.","def":"affright"},"H4035":{"lemma":"מְגוּרָה","xlit":"mᵉgûwrâh","gloss":"barn, fear.","def":"a fright; also a granary"},"H4036":{"lemma":"מָגוֹר מִסָּבִיב","xlit":"Mâgôwr miç-Çâbîyb","gloss":"Magormissabib.","def":"Magor-mis-Sabib, a symbolic name of Pashur"},"H4037":{"lemma":"מַגְזֵרָה","xlit":"magzêrâh","gloss":"axe.","def":"a cutting implement, i.e. a blade"},"H4038":{"lemma":"מַגָּל","xlit":"maggâl","gloss":"sickle.","def":"a sickle"},"H4039":{"lemma":"מְגִלָּה","xlit":"mᵉgillâh","gloss":"roll, volume.","def":"a roll"},"H4040":{"lemma":"מְגִלָּה","xlit":"mᵉgillâh","gloss":"roll.","def":"{a roll}"},"H4041":{"lemma":"מְגַמָּה","xlit":"mᵉgammâh","gloss":"sup up.","def":"properly, accumulation, i.e. impulse or direction"},"H4042":{"lemma":"מָגַן","xlit":"mâgan","gloss":"deliver.","def":"properly, to shield; encompass with; figuratively, to rescue, to hand safely over (i.e. surrender)"},"H4043":{"lemma":"מָגֵן","xlit":"mâgên","gloss":"[idiom] armed, buckler, defence, ruler, [phrase] scale, shield.","def":"a shield (i.e. the small one or buckler); figuratively, a protector; also the scaly hide of the crocodile"},"H4044":{"lemma":"מְגִנָּה","xlit":"mᵉginnâh","gloss":"sorrow. See also H4043 (מָגֵן).","def":"a covering (in a bad sense), i.e. blindness or obduracy"},"H4045":{"lemma":"מִגְעֶרֶת","xlit":"migʻereth","gloss":"rebuke.","def":"reproof (i.e. curse)"},"H4046":{"lemma":"מַגֵּפָה","xlit":"maggêphâh","gloss":"([idiom] be) plague(-d), slaughter, stroke.","def":"a pestilence; by analogy, defeat"},"H4047":{"lemma":"מַגְפִּיעָשׁ","xlit":"Magpîyʻâsh","gloss":"Magpiash.","def":"Magpiash, an Israelite"},"H4048":{"lemma":"מָגַר","xlit":"mâgar","gloss":"cast down, terror.","def":"to yield up; intensively, to precipitate"},"H4049":{"lemma":"מְגַר","xlit":"mᵉgar","gloss":"destroy.","def":"to overthrow"},"H4050":{"lemma":"מְגֵרָה","xlit":"mᵉgêrâh","gloss":"axe, saw.","def":"a saw"},"H4051":{"lemma":"מִגְרוֹן","xlit":"Migrôwn","gloss":"Migron.","def":"Migron, a place in Palestine"},"H4052":{"lemma":"מִגְרָעָה","xlit":"migrâʻâh","gloss":"narrowed rest.","def":"a ledge or offset"},"H4053":{"lemma":"מִגְרָפָה","xlit":"migrâphâh","gloss":"clod.","def":"something thrown off (by the spade), i.e. a clod"},"H4054":{"lemma":"מִגְרָשׁ","xlit":"migrâsh","gloss":"cast out, suburb.","def":"a suburb (i.e. open country whither flocks are driven from pasture); hence, the area around abuilding, or the margin of the sea"},"H4055":{"lemma":"מַד","xlit":"mad","gloss":"armour, clothes, garment, judgment, measure, raiment, stature.","def":"properly, extent, i.e. height; also a measure; by implication, a vesture (as measured); also a carpet"},"H4056":{"lemma":"מַדְבַּח","xlit":"madbach","gloss":"altar.","def":"a sacrificial altar"},"H4057":{"lemma":"מִדְבָּר","xlit":"midbâr","gloss":"desert, south, speech, wilderness.","def":"a pasture (i.e. open field, whither cattle are driven); by implication, a desert; also speech (including its organs)"},"H4058":{"lemma":"מָדַד","xlit":"mâdad","gloss":"measure, mete, stretch self.","def":"properly, to stretch; by implication, to measure (as if by stretching a line); figuratively, to be extended"},"H4059":{"lemma":"מִדַּד","xlit":"middad","gloss":"be gone.","def":"flight"},"H4060":{"lemma":"מִדָּה","xlit":"middâh","gloss":"garment, measure(-ing, meteyard, piece, size, (great) stature, tribute, wide.","def":"properly, extension, i.e. height or breadth; also a measure (including its standard); hence a portion (as measured) or a vestment; specifically, tribute (as measured)"},"H4061":{"lemma":"מִדָּה","xlit":"middâh","gloss":"toll, tribute.","def":"tribute in money"},"H4062":{"lemma":"מַדְהֵבָה","xlit":"madhêbâh","gloss":"golden city.","def":"goldmaking, i.e. exactness"},"H4063":{"lemma":"מֶדֶו","xlit":"medev","gloss":"garment.","def":"properly, extent, i.e. measure; by implication, a dress (as measured)"},"H4064":{"lemma":"מַדְוֶה","xlit":"madveh","gloss":"disease.","def":"sickness"},"H4065":{"lemma":"